          "difficulty": 1,
          "prompt": "Nia has 6 times as many beads as Eli. Eli has 14 beads. How many beads does Nia have?",
          "workedSolution": {
            "steps": [
              "“6 times as many” means multiply Eli’s amount by 6.",
              "Write 6 × 14.",
              "6 × 14 = 84, so Nia has 84 beads."
